'''Sprouting Madness''' is a [[debuff]] related to [[The Elder]]'s siphon skill. It is applied while players are in the siphon's cone area of effect.

'''Sprouting Madness''' applies a -80% [[action speed]] (-60% in [[Uber Elder]] encounter) debuff to the player. It can be negated through various methods such as {{il|Kaom's Roots}} or passives from the [[Juggernaut]] or [[Trickster]]. '''Sprouting Madness''' does not deal damage, but the siphon skill also applies [[Fed Upon]], which deals [[Physical damage|physical]] [[damage over time]]. The player must move out of the siphon's area of effect to remove both debuffs.
==Trivia==
Sprouting Madness shares the same status icon with [[Fed Upon]]. The file name is known as "ElderSiphon.dds".

==See also==
[[Crystalised Fear]], the debuff applied by the "super siphon" version of the skill.

